<main>
  <section class="sezione" id="gioco">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="due">
        <div>
          <p class="kicker">The game</p>
          <h2>Fight by writing</h2>
          <p class="intro">Dante carries no sword. Every attack is a verse he writes in his Book with a quill, and the letters tear off the page to strike. Combos are lines of poetry; spells cost Inspiration, which landed hits restore.</p>
        </div>
        <img src="/oltremondo/img/scrittura.webp" alt="Dante&#x27;s hand writes a verse on the Book with the quill" loading="lazy" width="960" height="720">
      </div>
      <div class="tratti"><div class="tratto"><h3>The Weight of the Soul</h3><p>Every choice makes Dante&#x27;s soul lighter or heavier. The judges of the dead read it, and the fights change with it.</p></div><div class="tratto"><h3>Deliberate combat</h3><p>Measured fights, stamina, dodges and parries. The Souls you lose when you die must be recovered.</p></div><div class="tratto"><h3>The poem, faithfully</h3><p>Places, guardians and verses come from the Commedia. Dialogue in Italian and English.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="riga"></div>
  <section class="sezione" id="personaggi">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="kicker">Characters</p>
      <h2>Who walks with Dante</h2>
      <div class="personaggi"><article class="persona"><div class="ritratto"><img src="/oltremondo/img/dante.webp" alt="Dante in his red hood with the laurel crown" loading="lazy"></div><h3>Dante</h3><p>The poet, lost in the dark wood. He fights with a quill and his Book.</p></article><article class="persona"><div class="ritratto"><img src="/oltremondo/img/virgilio.webp" alt="Virgil with white hair and beard and a laurel crown" loading="lazy"></div><h3>Virgil</h3><p>The guide sent by Beatrice. He rises from the fog as the beasts close in.</p></article><article class="persona"><div class="ritratto"><img src="/oltremondo/img/minosse_ritratto.webp" alt="Minos, half man and half serpent, his tail coiled around his body" loading="lazy"></div><h3>Minos</h3><p>The judge of the dead, half man and half serpent: he coils his tail to pass sentence.</p></article></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="riga"></div>
  <section class="sezione" id="galleria">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="kicker">Gallery</p>
      <h2>From the game</h2>
      <div class="galleria"><button type="button" data-grande="/oltremondo/img/g01.webp" data-alt="The lion on the forest path"><img src="/oltremondo/img/t01.webp" alt="The lion on the forest path" loading="lazy" width="640" height="360"></button><button type="button" data-grande="/oltremondo/img/g02.webp" data-alt="The inscription of the gate of Hell"><img src="/oltremondo/img/t02.webp" alt="The inscription of the gate of Hell" loading="lazy" width="640" height="360"></button><button type="button" data-grande="/oltremondo/img/g03.webp" data-alt="The lion rises in the clearing"><img src="/oltremondo/img/t03.webp" alt="The lion rises in the clearing" loading="lazy" width="640" height="360"></button><button type="button" data-grande="/oltremondo/img/g04.webp" data-alt="Crows over the dark wood"><img src="/oltremondo/img/t04.webp" alt="Crows over the dark wood" loading="lazy" width="640" height="360"></button><button type="button" data-grande="/oltremondo/img/g05.webp" data-alt="Into the lion&#x27;s clearing"><img src="/oltremondo/img/t05.webp" alt="Into the lion&#x27;s clearing" loading="lazy" width="640" height="360"></button><button type="button" data-grande="/oltremondo/img/g06.webp" data-alt="A damned soul and its chain"><img src="/oltremondo/img/t06.webp" alt="A damned soul and its chain" loading="lazy" width="640" height="360"></button><button type="button" data-grande="/oltremondo/img/g07.webp" data-alt="The door of Dante&#x27;s tower"><img src="/oltremondo/img/t07.webp" alt="The door of Dante&#x27;s tower" loading="lazy" width="640" height="360"></button></div>
      <p class="galleria-nota">In-game captures from the vertical slice.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="riga"></div>
  <section class="sezione" id="viaggio">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="kicker">The journey</p>
      <h2>The whole poem</h2>
      <p class="intro">The game starts in Florence, in Dante&#x27;s study, and follows the whole Commedia.</p>
      <div class="cantiche"><div class="cantica prima"><p class="kicker">First</p><h3>Inferno</h3><p>The nine circles of Hell, from the dark wood to the frozen lake of Cocytus.</p><a class="vai" href="#inferno" data-regno="inferno">Explore it in 3D &rarr;</a></div><div class="cantica"><p class="kicker">Then</p><h3>Purgatorio</h3><p>The mountain of penance, terrace after terrace, up to the Earthly Paradise.</p><a class="vai" href="#purgatorio" data-regno="purgatorio">Explore it in 3D &rarr;</a></div><div class="cantica"><p class="kicker">At last</p><h3>Paradiso</h3><p>The nine heavens, up to the Empyrean.</p><a class="vai" href="#paradiso" data-regno="paradiso">Explore it in 3D &rarr;</a></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="riga"></div>
  <section class="sezione" id="segui">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="kicker">Follow</p>
      <h2>Follow the journey</h2>
      <p class="intro">A devlog post every few days: new places, creatures and verses as they are made.</p>
      <div class="segui"><span class="bottone steam">Coming soon to Steam</span><a class="bottone vuoto" href="https://www.instagram.com/oltremondo_iter_animae/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a><a class="bottone vuoto" href="https://bsky.app/profile/gianlubackdrop.bsky.social" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Bluesky</a><a class="bottone vuoto" href="https://www.facebook.com/1425051710685362" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Facebook</a><a class="bottone vuoto" href="https://x.com/monk3y_85" target="_blank" rel="noopener">X</a></div>
      <p class="stampa">Press and business: <a href="mailto:gianlucascattarella@gmail.com">gianlucascattarella@gmail.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

